Built with PriorLabs-TabPFN.

This software uses the TabPFN v2 regressor weights by Prior Labs GmbH, under
the Prior Labs License 1.1 (Apache License 2.0 with an additional attribution
provision). A copy of that license is in licenses/PriorLabs-License-1.1.txt.
The weights are downloaded at run time from
https://huggingface.co/Prior-Labs/TabPFN-v2-reg and are not included here.
The tabpfn Python package is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

FIT files are read with fitdecode (MIT License).

Some modules started from z2analyzer by the same author
(https://github.com/dsiacci/z2analyzer, Apache License 2.0): reading FIT
files and distances along a track.

Data read at run time, never shipped in this repository:
- Wind model grids: Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com), CC BY 4.0, with the
  Météo-France AROME and ECMWF IFS models.
- Station measurements: Météo-France, hourly climatological data
  (meteo.data.gouv.fr), Licence Ouverte 2.0 (Etalab).
- Airport reports (METAR): Iowa Environmental Mesonet, Iowa State University
  (https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu).
